      "writtenOn": "2022-03-28T04:47:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "A new thread (mCaptureThread) is created from startStream(), which is joined in stopStream(). If in the randomized order of API execution, stopStream() is not called after invoking startStream(), thread memory would leak and a point would reach where no more threads could be created, leading to fuzzer abort. This usually happens within 10 mins of fuzzer run.",
      "parentUuid": "e69a5fb2_7e68fdfc",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 117,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 118,
